! DBG85C.DBG - what the debugger says of a shareable image's modules (README.md, D8).
SHOW IMAGE
SHOW MODULE
!> SHOW MODULE/SHARE
SHOW MODULE/SHARE
!> SET IMAGE DBG85S
SET IMAGE DBG85S
SHOW IMAGE
SHOW MODULE
!> SET MODULE/ALL
SET MODULE/ALL
SHOW SYMBOL *
!> SET BREAK SHR85
SET BREAK SHR85
GO
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!> EXAMINE .PC
EXAMINE .PC
GO
